Aerie-Purpose: Register chrome://aerie-list-source, the read-only text/plain view of a filter list the user added by address, with the WebUI config map.
Aerie-Upstream-Area: chrome/browser/ui/webui/chrome_web_ui_configs.cc, chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn
Aerie-Kind: hook

Issue #108. The page is a WebUI (AerieListSourceUIConfig, in the overlay
under chrome/browser/ui/webui/aerie_guard_settings). Settings opens it for "View
source". It serves the saved text of one list, addressed by list id, as
text/plain, so a web page can neither navigate to it nor frame it and the
list is never rendered as HTML. It is registered with the config map and
nothing else: no host constant, no histogram variant, no resources.

--- a/chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/webui/BUILD.gn
@@ -55,6 +55,7 @@
     "//chrome/browser/ui/webui/accessibility",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/webui/actor_internals",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/webui/aerie_guard",
+    "//chrome/browser/ui/webui/aerie_guard_settings:list_source",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/webui/autofill_and_password_manager_internals",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/webui/bluetooth_internals",
     "//chrome/browser/ui/webui/chrome_urls",
